<!--
  CIVILIZATION_WARMSTONE_STALWART - proof-of-concept civ for the mod pipeline.

  Reflects only settled Beyond Warmsun canon for the Stalwarts (species_naming_brief.md,
  homeworld_brief.md #Species Biomes): closed-canopy rainforest origin, high endurance,
  toxin resistance, pain resistance, history of violent resistance to colonization.
  No invented lore beyond mechanically translating those traits.

  Unique ability: land units ignore terrain movement cost (reuses vanilla's existing
  ABILITY_IGNORE_TERRAIN_COST, the same ability Helicopters get - endurance across
  rough terrain) plus a flat +3 combat strength (reuses MODIFIER_PLAYER_UNITS_ADJUST_COMBAT_STRENGTH,
  unconditional - pain/toxin resistance in a fight). Both grounded in confirmed
  working vanilla patterns, see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.

  Unique unit and unique improvement follow the exact structural pattern of the
  installed game's own Australia DLC (UNIT_DIGGER / IMPROVEMENT_OUTBACK_STATION),
  confirmed by reading those files directly.

  Placeholder Name/Description values are literal internal Type IDs, not authored
  copy. No CivilizationCitizenNames list is defined (that's authored flavor text,
  out of scope here) - see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for what a human author still needs
  to add.
-->
